; CX app, text form.
[app]
name = Programs: fetch over UDP at 128 bytes
description = Test demo: the fetch with every packet at most 128 bytes, in the short forms
kind = fetch
entry = fetch.txt

[args]
10.0.2.2:7004
03e489240a78d8a85713f5b6d22749632d8268e238c40b9aca99f54c44de11828d
fib-and-primes
packet=128
forms=short
This app holds no program. It fetches the program its args name from the
server its args give, over UDP, and checks the manifest signature and
every block hash. A program signed by one of the trusted keys of its args
runs at once, and one from any other key runs only once the user
confirms it. See docs/ProgramDistribution.md.
